WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:45.322 --> 01:47.922
=Episode 25=

01:47.955 --> 01:51.380
(No. 44, Kangnan Road)

01:52.309 --> 01:53.990
Mom, what are we having for dinner?

01:54.026 --> 01:55.560
Zhajiangmian.
[*Noodles with fried bean sauce]

01:57.109 --> 01:57.510
Dad,

01:58.350 --> 01:59.189
come down.

01:59.189 --> 02:00.110
Don't fall.

02:00.469 --> 02:01.309
Come.

02:01.749 --> 02:03.150
I'll help you.

02:03.293 --> 02:04.493
Where should I put it?

02:05.710 --> 02:06.469
Here?

02:06.950 --> 02:08.097
- Okay.
- All right.

02:08.750 --> 02:09.269
And this too?

02:10.060 --> 02:12.115
I'll move the books
a little closer to the outside,

02:12.160 --> 02:13.540
so they're easier for you to reach.

02:13.549 --> 02:14.030
Sure.

02:14.697 --> 02:15.379
- Good.
- Okay.

02:15.380 --> 02:17.493
Don't worry about it.
I'll tidy up when I get back.

02:21.429 --> 02:22.149
Fang Muyang.

02:22.950 --> 02:25.030
This is where you lived as a kid?

02:25.030 --> 02:25.589
Yeah.

02:25.709 --> 02:27.669
We had a living room.

02:27.950 --> 02:28.910
It was next door.

02:30.470 --> 02:31.790
My parents and my sister

02:31.790 --> 02:33.382
slept on that side of the living room.

02:33.510 --> 02:34.470
My grandma and I

02:34.869 --> 02:36.269
slept on this side.

02:39.460 --> 02:41.101
(Fei)
Why is there a "Fei" carved here?

02:45.669 --> 02:46.669
That's your name.

02:47.709 --> 02:48.869
I carved it when I was 16.

02:49.750 --> 02:51.109
I didn't lie to your parents.

02:52.109 --> 02:53.549
I did like you back then.

02:58.829 --> 02:59.630
What are you doing?

03:03.350 --> 03:05.149
I'm carving your name next to mine.

03:06.989 --> 03:07.389
Here.

03:07.429 --> 03:08.560
One, two, three.

03:16.950 --> 03:17.910
In the future,

03:18.389 --> 03:19.709
our child

03:20.149 --> 03:21.750
can witness our love.

03:29.950 --> 03:30.669
Hey.

03:30.989 --> 03:32.109
I'm not finished yet.

03:32.350 --> 03:32.950
Stop carving.

03:33.470 --> 03:34.149
No.

03:34.149 --> 03:35.350
Mom and Dad are here.

03:35.350 --> 03:36.030
Hey.

03:36.149 --> 03:36.630
Dad!

03:37.860 --> 03:38.661
What's wrong?

03:39.472 --> 03:39.985
Dad,

03:40.950 --> 03:41.989
do we have hot water?

03:42.685 --> 03:43.429
Yes.

03:43.429 --> 03:46.030
I'll get the thermos for you.

03:46.030 --> 03:47.510
It's fine. I'll go with you.

03:53.685 --> 04:01.010
(Fei, Fang)

04:01.010 --> 04:05.247
(Jiangnan Municipal People's Hospital)

04:05.285 --> 04:07.429
(Patient: Jiang Fengying,
Admission Diagnosis: Intracranial Tumor)

04:07.429 --> 04:08.950
My grandma has high blood pressure.

04:09.269 --> 04:10.230
During anesthesia,

04:10.230 --> 04:11.030
make sure

04:11.030 --> 04:13.269
to keep her heart rate
and blood pressure stable.

04:14.149 --> 04:15.030
Monitor her closely.

04:15.109 --> 04:15.549
Okay.

04:16.093 --> 04:17.780
Her heart and lungs aren't good either.

04:18.229 --> 04:21.589
There could be myocardial ischemia
or a heart attack during surgery.

04:21.909 --> 04:24.229
You must pay close attention
to that risk.

04:25.909 --> 04:26.469
Dr. Huang,

04:28.149 --> 04:29.510
I'm entrusting my grandma to you.

04:30.469 --> 04:32.229
I've only performed
one craniotomy before.

04:32.709 --> 04:34.447
You were always the lead surgeon.

04:34.535 --> 04:35.816
Maybe you do it.

04:35.909 --> 04:36.797
Qu Hua

04:37.349 --> 04:38.447
can't do it.

04:51.110 --> 04:52.349
Please go prepare first.

05:23.229 --> 05:24.029
Qu Hua.

05:28.772 --> 05:29.852
Do you want to do

05:30.222 --> 05:31.022
Grandma's surgery?

05:45.709 --> 05:46.709
My dad is right.

05:48.269 --> 05:49.070
I shouldn't.

05:50.630 --> 05:52.149
After Yan's surgery failed,

05:53.310 --> 05:54.349
I didn't touch a scalpel

05:54.789 --> 05:55.950
for a year and a half.

05:57.550 --> 05:59.349
If this surgery fails too,

06:00.522 --> 06:01.402
I don't think

06:01.403 --> 06:03.226
I'll ever step into
an operating room again.

06:09.710 --> 06:10.747
I'm asking,

06:11.630 --> 06:12.909
do you want to do it?

06:18.469 --> 06:19.070
I do.

06:20.670 --> 06:21.469
Of course I do.

06:22.389 --> 06:24.110
Grandma's surgery
is extremely difficult.

06:24.110 --> 06:25.750
Dr. Huang doesn't have
much experience.

06:26.110 --> 06:27.710
If something unexpected happens,

06:27.710 --> 06:28.810
I'm worried Grandma...

06:32.670 --> 06:33.630
Then don't hesitate.

06:34.670 --> 06:36.110
If it were me lying sick today,

06:36.750 --> 06:37.709
I would choose you

06:37.709 --> 06:39.310
without hesitation.

06:40.550 --> 06:42.469
If Grandma could speak today,

06:42.950 --> 06:44.909
I believe she would
make the same choice.

06:51.750 --> 06:52.430
Qu Hua,

06:53.110 --> 06:54.029
you love her so much.

06:55.229 --> 06:56.870
Then take on this responsibility.

07:11.160 --> 07:14.322
(Always Be Ready to Make Contributions
to the Four Modernizations)

07:14.382 --> 07:15.826
(Application Form)
Vice Director Chen,

07:15.830 --> 07:18.740
I'd like to apply for next year's
Worker-Peasant-Soldier university quota.

07:18.750 --> 07:19.950
This is my application.

07:30.149 --> 07:30.909
Fei Ni,

07:31.349 --> 07:34.709
I heard you've applied
for several years in a row.

07:35.310 --> 07:36.899
Can you tell me

07:36.900 --> 07:38.871
why you want to go
to university so badly?

07:39.750 --> 07:41.630
I want to learn more skills

07:42.140 --> 07:44.448
and come back to the factory
to contribute even more.

08:00.900 --> 08:01.826
Vice Director Chen.

08:06.750 --> 08:08.110
It's because I like studying.

08:08.610 --> 08:09.837
I like writing.

08:10.460 --> 08:11.604
I want to become a writer.

08:12.149 --> 08:14.029
I'm not saying being a worker is bad.

08:14.349 --> 08:15.709
I do like weaving.

08:16.349 --> 08:17.269
But compared to that,

08:17.269 --> 08:18.630
I want to go to university more.

08:18.804 --> 08:20.182
I'm sorry, Vice Director Chen.

08:20.248 --> 08:21.900
I know this way of thinking isn't right.

08:21.909 --> 08:22.829
It's wrong.

08:22.829 --> 08:23.229
But...

08:23.709 --> 08:25.469
Where do you think you're wrong?

08:35.950 --> 08:37.629
Actively striving to improve yourself

08:38.070 --> 08:39.550
and pursue your dreams.

08:40.030 --> 08:41.310
How could that be wrong?

08:43.070 --> 08:43.709
I know

08:44.430 --> 08:46.910
you've faced a lot of setbacks

08:47.109 --> 08:48.270
because of university.

08:48.749 --> 08:51.349
Take them as tests.

08:52.670 --> 08:55.790
As for next year's
Worker-Peasant-Soldier university quota,

08:56.749 --> 08:58.829
after careful consideration

08:59.509 --> 09:01.310
and taking public opinion into account,

09:01.848 --> 09:03.471
the factory leadership has decided

09:03.749 --> 09:05.070
to recommend Comrade Fei Ni

09:05.629 --> 09:08.349
to study in the Chinese Department
at Ningzhou University.

09:12.190 --> 09:12.589
I...

09:13.030 --> 09:13.629
What?

09:13.910 --> 09:14.910
Are you not willing?

09:16.150 --> 09:17.070
No, no, no.

09:17.589 --> 09:18.310
I'm willing.

09:18.709 --> 09:19.190
I am.

09:19.670 --> 09:20.670
Thank you, Vice Director.

09:20.869 --> 09:21.829
Thank you.

09:22.360 --> 09:23.580
Don't get too excited yet.

09:23.740 --> 09:25.626
It still has to go through public notice

09:25.648 --> 09:27.550
before it's officially announced.

09:27.629 --> 09:28.550
But during this time,

09:28.550 --> 09:30.030
you can start preparing

09:30.030 --> 09:31.469
to report to the university.

09:32.950 --> 09:34.030
Thank you, Vice Director.

09:39.937 --> 09:42.182
(Jiangcheng Daily)

09:42.190 --> 09:45.629
Your comic serial
is about to stop running.

09:47.829 --> 09:48.629
Don't worry.

09:49.190 --> 09:51.150
That's actually good news.

09:52.190 --> 09:53.404
Since it began serialization,

09:53.471 --> 09:55.360
the response has been
overwhelmingly positive,

09:55.382 --> 09:56.626
and has received rave reviews.

09:57.235 --> 09:58.390
The organization has decided

09:58.500 --> 09:59.982
to publish it as a standalone volume.

10:01.560 --> 10:02.580
Thank you, Uncle Fu.

10:02.950 --> 10:04.270
Don't thank me yet.

10:04.390 --> 10:06.030
There's just one thing.

10:07.190 --> 10:08.310
The organization

10:08.509 --> 10:10.310
wants Mr. Yuan

10:10.310 --> 10:12.469
to lead the project.

10:18.989 --> 10:21.109
I know you don't like making changes.

10:21.709 --> 10:22.697
That's fine.

10:23.022 --> 10:25.662
Just hand your original drafts
over to Mr. Yuan.

10:26.310 --> 10:27.030
Mr. Fu,

10:27.550 --> 10:28.070
I was...

10:28.070 --> 10:29.790
Let me finish.

10:30.509 --> 10:30.989
First,

10:31.349 --> 10:33.030
your right of authorship remains.

10:33.950 --> 10:34.509
Second,

10:37.829 --> 10:39.629
Mr. Yuan's opinion

10:40.109 --> 10:42.989
carries weight here.

10:43.430 --> 10:44.989
As long as you say yes,

10:45.829 --> 10:47.390
you'll become permanent immediately.

10:48.629 --> 10:49.629
I can give up on that.

10:51.790 --> 10:53.109
Young man,

10:53.349 --> 10:55.190
why don't you understand?

10:55.190 --> 10:57.589
You're only able to stay at the paper

10:57.589 --> 10:59.550
because you're drawing under Mr. Yuan.

10:59.550 --> 11:00.989
If he says a word against you,

11:01.589 --> 11:02.790
you'll be in trouble.

11:02.790 --> 11:03.430
Mr. Fu,

11:05.150 --> 11:06.629
I like this publishing house.

11:08.349 --> 11:09.550
I like this job.

11:10.271 --> 11:11.950
But I don't have to stay at all costs.

11:18.550 --> 11:19.070
Fine.

11:20.030 --> 11:20.950
You've got backbone.

11:21.829 --> 11:23.989
You may not care about this job.

11:25.430 --> 11:26.790
But what about your family?

11:44.749 --> 11:46.190
(Your parents just came back.)

11:46.430 --> 11:47.989
(Their job aren't settled.)

11:47.989 --> 11:50.109
(No job means no salary.)

11:50.935 --> 11:52.215
(Don't you and Fei Ni)

11:52.469 --> 11:54.430
(want a house of your own?)

11:54.749 --> 11:55.550
Fang Muyang.

11:59.229 --> 12:00.430
Fang Muyang,

12:01.550 --> 12:03.070
I have good news.

12:04.229 --> 12:07.430
Vice Director Chen recommended me
to attend Ningzhou University.

12:08.150 --> 12:08.709
Really?

12:09.430 --> 12:10.430
That's wonderful.

12:11.226 --> 12:12.740
You're going to Ningzhou University.

12:12.749 --> 12:13.709
Ningzhou?

12:14.070 --> 12:16.629
It takes two days by train.

12:17.109 --> 12:18.430
It's fine.

12:18.560 --> 12:20.604
I can come back
during winter and summer breaks.

12:20.709 --> 12:21.709
It's just that

12:22.070 --> 12:23.829
if I go to university,

12:23.829 --> 12:25.550
my income will be affected.

12:25.550 --> 12:27.829
You'll have to take care of it.

12:36.150 --> 12:36.829
Fei Ni,

12:37.950 --> 12:39.349
I have good news, too.

12:41.248 --> 12:43.190
Uncle Fu talked to me
about becoming permanent.

12:43.749 --> 12:44.790
He said it should be soon.

12:44.982 --> 12:46.070
After becoming permanent,

12:46.070 --> 12:47.493
I might even get allocated housing.

12:47.620 --> 12:49.140
We could have a home of our own again.

12:49.430 --> 12:50.070
Really?

12:50.109 --> 12:50.550
Really.

12:51.109 --> 12:51.989
Fang Muyang,

12:52.190 --> 12:53.390
I truly feel

12:53.709 --> 12:56.190
our life is getting better and better.

13:02.950 --> 13:03.790
Me too.

13:27.150 --> 13:27.670
Mr. Yuan,

13:28.790 --> 13:29.749
I came today

13:31.030 --> 13:32.270
to apologize.

13:34.550 --> 13:35.550
What have you done wrong?

13:37.869 --> 13:38.550
Last time,

13:39.026 --> 13:40.826
you gave many valuable
revision suggestions

13:41.190 --> 13:42.989
on my comics.

13:43.509 --> 13:44.589
I was too foolish

13:45.270 --> 13:46.150
to understand them.

13:46.950 --> 13:48.190
So today,

13:48.550 --> 13:49.550
I'm here to ask

13:49.950 --> 13:51.229
for another chance.

13:58.550 --> 14:00.469
These are my revision notes.

14:03.469 --> 14:04.829
That textile factory worker

14:05.035 --> 14:06.200
must be removed.

14:07.980 --> 14:09.071
As we discussed last time,

14:09.190 --> 14:10.589
change her to a hospital nurse.

14:12.030 --> 14:13.190
Revise her story as well.

14:13.670 --> 14:16.829
Make it that she rushed alone
to the disaster area to rescue people.

14:17.272 --> 14:19.270
Then have her contact an infection

14:19.989 --> 14:20.869
to show her spirit

14:21.229 --> 14:23.270
of staying on the front line
despite injury.

14:23.629 --> 14:24.229
Understand?

14:26.749 --> 14:27.550
Yes.

14:28.430 --> 14:29.670
The protagonist

14:30.026 --> 14:31.604
must have universal representatives.

14:31.950 --> 14:34.749
Delete the surgeon.

14:34.782 --> 14:36.426
The role overlaps
with that of the nurse.

14:36.440 --> 14:38.660
And that Guoqiang,
he's not typical enough. Delete him.

14:38.680 --> 14:40.850
Especially this description
of the real-life prototype

14:40.950 --> 14:41.749
is too long.

14:42.310 --> 14:42.869
Redundant.

14:43.070 --> 14:43.509
Cut it.

14:43.597 --> 14:44.118
Cut it.

14:44.190 --> 14:45.070
Cut this too.

14:45.709 --> 14:46.469
Besides that,

14:46.749 --> 14:47.749
we need creation.

14:48.070 --> 14:49.790
We need ten model figures in total.

14:50.310 --> 14:51.469
Best if one or two

14:51.469 --> 14:53.229
are left disabled from disaster relief,

14:53.390 --> 14:54.670
or even sacrifice their lives.

14:54.989 --> 14:56.509
For those who sacrifice,

14:56.829 --> 14:59.589
ideally, they have two children
under five.

14:59.590 --> 15:01.550
When they hear the news
of their father's death,

15:01.589 --> 15:02.589
they don't cry.

15:02.869 --> 15:04.270
Instead, they comfort their mother.

15:05.670 --> 15:06.469
"Mom,

15:07.030 --> 15:07.869
don't cry.

15:08.589 --> 15:09.430
When I grow up,

15:09.670 --> 15:11.589
I'll be a hero like Dad."

15:11.950 --> 15:12.749
That's the only way

15:13.550 --> 15:14.670
to truly move readers.

15:16.150 --> 15:16.989
Understood?

15:20.337 --> 15:20.950
Understood.

15:21.310 --> 15:23.150
Submit the revised draft
as soon as possible.

15:25.270 --> 15:26.150
Yes, Mr. Yuan.

15:32.697 --> 15:34.147
(Jiangnan Municipal People's Hospital)

15:34.190 --> 15:35.030
Fang,

15:35.430 --> 15:36.229
what's going on?

15:36.670 --> 15:37.310
Why did Qu Hua

15:37.509 --> 15:39.829
suddenly decide to perform
the surgery himself?

15:41.270 --> 15:42.469
I encouraged him.

15:42.550 --> 15:42.989
You!

15:44.550 --> 15:46.030
What if something goes wrong?

15:46.270 --> 15:48.030
He won't recover from it for life.

15:48.829 --> 15:49.310
Dad,

15:49.626 --> 15:51.670
if something goes wrong
even with Qu Hua operating,

15:51.860 --> 15:54.048
wouldn't it be even riskier
for Dr. Huang to operate?

15:54.822 --> 15:55.385
If Grandma

15:55.385 --> 15:57.105
really had an accident,

15:57.430 --> 15:58.560
do you think Qu Hua

15:58.560 --> 15:59.749
could live with that?

15:59.749 --> 16:00.070
You!

16:00.070 --> 16:00.670
Qu,

16:01.109 --> 16:02.790
Mujing is right.

16:02.950 --> 16:04.390
I believe in Hua.

16:06.989 --> 16:07.629
It'll be fine.

16:08.190 --> 16:08.950
Come, sit.

16:18.509 --> 16:19.869
Mu, this way.

16:22.709 --> 16:23.469
This is the office

16:23.670 --> 16:26.270
of the Mathematics Department
at Jiangcheng University.

16:27.070 --> 16:28.790
Currently used by the research group.

16:38.847 --> 16:43.660
(Educators must first be educated.)

16:50.109 --> 16:51.030
These past few years,

16:51.430 --> 16:52.509
we have achieved

16:53.109 --> 16:54.869
some modest results.

16:54.937 --> 16:57.471
At least we haven't disappointed
the organization's expectations.

17:02.670 --> 17:03.349
Wu,

17:04.390 --> 17:06.110
arrange a desk for me.

17:06.430 --> 17:08.509
I'd like to study
the latest findings as well.

17:09.309 --> 17:10.190
Well...

17:10.190 --> 17:11.229
Don't worry.

17:11.390 --> 17:13.950
Although the university
hasn't officially restored my position,

17:14.309 --> 17:16.590
they've verbally allowed me
to participate again.

17:16.590 --> 17:18.309
They assigned me a dorm room.

17:18.630 --> 17:19.430
Mu,

17:19.430 --> 17:20.709
that's not what I meant.

17:21.110 --> 17:22.430
Our project team

17:22.590 --> 17:24.430
has a special member.

17:25.069 --> 17:25.670
Who?

17:26.910 --> 17:27.830
Fang Mujing.

17:30.590 --> 17:31.430
Of course,

17:31.709 --> 17:32.910
we could assign Mujing

17:32.910 --> 17:34.469
to another project.

17:37.069 --> 17:37.549
No need.

17:38.309 --> 17:39.110
She does her work.

17:39.309 --> 17:40.150
I'll do mine.

17:46.935 --> 17:50.860
(Unite and Achieve Greater Victory!
Staff Family Housing Compound)

17:52.709 --> 17:53.590
Ye Feng.

17:54.630 --> 17:55.229
Ye Feng.

17:59.229 --> 18:01.229
When you meet Ling Yi's senior,

18:01.590 --> 18:02.390
be smart.

18:02.390 --> 18:03.093
Do you hear me?

18:03.248 --> 18:05.210
He's someone
who can put in a good word for you.

18:06.430 --> 18:07.630
I'm not mute.

18:07.630 --> 18:08.910
I don't need him to speak for me.

18:09.989 --> 18:10.789
Ye Feng,

18:11.229 --> 18:13.029
it was hard for me to build a connection

18:13.029 --> 18:14.110
with Chen Donghua.

18:14.110 --> 18:14.950
I tried for so long

18:14.950 --> 18:16.635
before he agreed
to have a meal with you.

18:16.872 --> 18:17.872
Don't ignore it.

18:18.960 --> 18:21.740
He's the secretary to the director
of the Textile Industry Bureau.

18:21.826 --> 18:23.182
You have to take this seriously.

18:23.229 --> 18:24.229
Alright, Mom.

18:24.785 --> 18:26.985
If he asks,

18:26.985 --> 18:29.135
just say you're working hard

18:29.135 --> 18:31.078
in the canteen,

18:31.389 --> 18:32.910
but if there's another opportunity,

18:32.985 --> 18:35.304
you'd love to contribute more
to the people.

18:37.870 --> 18:38.430
Okay.

18:42.630 --> 18:43.150
Take this.

18:43.150 --> 18:44.110
Say you bought it.

18:44.870 --> 18:45.269
Fine.

18:45.269 --> 18:45.989
You can go.

18:46.029 --> 18:46.749
Bye, Mom.

18:48.430 --> 18:48.830
Alright.

18:48.830 --> 18:50.190
Mom, we're leaving.

19:08.860 --> 19:09.540
Chen.

19:10.989 --> 19:11.590
Ling Yi.

19:12.190 --> 19:13.430
Sorry to keep you waiting.

19:13.682 --> 19:14.922
Let me introduce you.

19:14.922 --> 19:16.442
This is my husband, Ye Feng.

19:17.150 --> 19:19.630
(Chen Donghua)
You're Ye Feng from the canteen?

19:20.350 --> 19:20.950
Yes.

19:21.430 --> 19:22.069
Chen,

19:22.229 --> 19:23.870
we brought you a little something.

19:24.700 --> 19:25.471
Just put it there.

19:26.590 --> 19:27.229
Sit.

19:28.390 --> 19:29.469
Ye, sit.

19:29.590 --> 19:30.029
Alright.

19:33.229 --> 19:34.549
Here, have some soda.

19:35.110 --> 19:36.029
Thank you.

19:37.390 --> 19:37.789
Ye.

19:38.110 --> 19:39.185
I'll pour myself.

19:39.185 --> 19:39.865
Thank you.

19:43.229 --> 19:43.830
Ling Yi,

19:44.390 --> 19:45.870
when I went back to school,

19:46.509 --> 19:48.509
Professor Xu praised you highly.

19:48.582 --> 19:50.590
Said that in all these years
in our department,

19:50.749 --> 19:52.029
the two best writers

19:52.350 --> 19:53.309
were you

19:53.509 --> 19:54.749
and me.

19:55.549 --> 19:57.022
I'm flattered.

19:57.709 --> 19:59.590
Too much modesty becomes arrogance.

19:59.910 --> 20:01.229
I've read your articles.

20:01.350 --> 20:02.190
Very impressive.

20:02.430 --> 20:04.630
Better than some of the writers
in our bureau.

20:05.229 --> 20:07.830
I heard you're going to work
in the Publicity Department

20:08.150 --> 20:10.709
of Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory
after graduation.

20:11.510 --> 20:12.030
Yes.

20:12.340 --> 20:13.160
Eat the dishes.

20:13.549 --> 20:14.350
Ye, eat some.

20:15.789 --> 20:16.309
Yes.

20:17.110 --> 20:19.029
I was accepted by the factory.

20:20.390 --> 20:21.430
That's good.

20:21.430 --> 20:24.093
Do well. Train yourself
at the grassroots level for a few years.

20:24.204 --> 20:25.226
When there's a chance,

20:25.271 --> 20:26.830
you could be transferred to the bureau.

20:27.789 --> 20:29.150
Thank you, Chen.

20:29.989 --> 20:31.010
Actually,

20:31.235 --> 20:33.116
my job isn't urgent.

20:33.749 --> 20:35.522
If there's another opportunity,

20:36.160 --> 20:38.555
could you perhaps help Ye Feng
with a transfer?

20:42.630 --> 20:43.269
Him?

20:44.309 --> 20:45.229
To where?

20:45.789 --> 20:46.630
Another canteen?

20:56.390 --> 20:57.410
Chen,

20:57.749 --> 21:00.029
Ye Feng is only in the canteen

21:00.029 --> 21:02.469
because there wasn't a suitable position
at the factory.

21:02.830 --> 21:03.622
His mother

21:03.622 --> 21:05.862
once oversaw production.

21:06.310 --> 21:09.310
He's very familiar
with light industry operations.

21:10.789 --> 21:13.110
He's also been studying accounting
on his own.

21:13.350 --> 21:15.469
If there's an account clerk position,

21:15.749 --> 21:17.085
could you...

21:22.789 --> 21:23.350
Alright.

21:24.150 --> 21:25.350
I'll think about it.

21:25.749 --> 21:27.430
Chen, let me toast you.

21:30.830 --> 21:31.670
Ye, drink.

21:43.749 --> 21:44.749
I'll use the restroom.

21:45.709 --> 21:46.572
Sure.

21:54.229 --> 21:54.830
Ling Yi,

21:56.115 --> 21:57.220
why are you trying so hard

21:57.229 --> 21:58.509
to flatter that Chen Donghua?

21:59.110 --> 22:00.269
You're a woman.

22:00.340 --> 22:02.337
Isn't it humiliating
to lower yourself like that?

22:03.830 --> 22:05.229
Lower myself?

22:05.810 --> 22:06.290
Ye Feng,

22:06.472 --> 22:07.597
get this straight.

22:07.789 --> 22:09.522
I'm doing this for your job.

22:10.029 --> 22:11.950
My job is fine.

22:12.789 --> 22:14.797
Besides, I don't know accounting.

22:14.830 --> 22:16.190
Even if he transferred me,

22:16.190 --> 22:17.110
I couldn't do it.

22:17.110 --> 22:18.229
Then learn.

22:19.229 --> 22:21.150
Are you planning to serve food
for your whole life?

22:21.150 --> 22:22.630
What's wrong with that?

22:22.960 --> 22:24.626
I didn't want that job
in the first place.

22:24.630 --> 22:25.937
You all persuaded me to take it.

22:26.160 --> 22:27.700
Now that I've finally gotten used to it,

22:27.700 --> 22:29.226
you want me to switch to accounting.

22:29.309 --> 22:30.029
I'm telling you,

22:30.715 --> 22:31.910
if you want to go, you go.

22:31.910 --> 22:32.710
I'm not going.

22:33.029 --> 22:35.022
And you don't ask your senior for me.

22:35.069 --> 22:35.950
I don't care.

22:45.789 --> 22:46.590
You're back.

22:47.749 --> 22:49.150
Did it go pretty well?

22:49.430 --> 22:50.830
You were gone quite a while.

22:51.229 --> 22:52.069
It was okay.

22:52.549 --> 22:54.069
What do you mean by okay?

22:54.509 --> 22:55.222
You're

22:55.670 --> 22:57.190
sweating.

22:57.448 --> 22:58.937
You went to play basketball again?

22:59.190 --> 23:00.430
Just a little while.

23:01.229 --> 23:02.549
A little while?

23:02.749 --> 23:04.350
Weren't you meeting Ling Yi's senior?

23:04.350 --> 23:05.789
Why did you play basketball instead?

23:05.950 --> 23:06.590
Mom,

23:07.029 --> 23:08.069
that guy...

23:08.069 --> 23:08.709
Mom,

23:10.229 --> 23:11.709
Chen thinks highly of him.

23:12.110 --> 23:13.029
Really?

23:13.789 --> 23:15.029
After dinner,

23:15.190 --> 23:17.150
Ye Feng played basketball with him.

23:17.150 --> 23:19.297
He said Ye Feng's smart.

23:19.297 --> 23:20.950
Working at the canteen
is a waste of talent.

23:20.989 --> 23:23.029
He suggested that he learn some finance,

23:23.029 --> 23:25.422
so he might transfer
to an account clerk position later.

23:25.870 --> 23:26.789
That's great.

23:27.071 --> 23:28.670
As expected of the chief's secretary.

23:28.830 --> 23:30.350
He has good judgment of talent.

23:30.910 --> 23:31.590
Ye Feng,

23:31.590 --> 23:32.670
study hard.

23:33.549 --> 23:35.630
Don't disappoint his expectations.

23:36.709 --> 23:37.830
Chen even recommended

23:37.830 --> 23:39.150
some professional books.

23:39.150 --> 23:40.029
Study them.

23:40.180 --> 23:41.226
Principles of Accounting

23:41.293 --> 23:43.360
(Principles of Accounting)
is an introductory textbook.

23:43.590 --> 23:45.590
This one covers the basics
of abacus calculation,

23:45.590 --> 23:47.860
like addition, subtraction,
multiplication, and division.

23:48.029 --> 23:50.029
(Abacus)
And some more specialized books.

23:50.029 --> 23:50.910
Read them all.

23:51.422 --> 23:52.672
(Abacus Manual)

23:53.989 --> 23:55.029
And this abacus.

23:55.350 --> 23:57.190
I bought it for you.

24:02.229 --> 24:03.950
Memorize the formulas,
and practice often.

24:04.269 --> 24:06.229
You should be proficient in a month.

24:08.549 --> 24:09.430
I'll try.

24:09.590 --> 24:10.709
What do you mean by try?

24:10.950 --> 24:12.350
You must master it.

24:12.910 --> 24:14.549
Ling Yi has paved the road for you.

24:14.830 --> 24:16.430
All you have to do is take a few steps.

24:16.630 --> 24:18.150
Stop playing basketball from now on.

24:18.350 --> 24:19.671
Play with abacus beads instead.

24:19.989 --> 24:20.590
Do you hear me?

24:21.190 --> 24:21.989
Study properly.

24:28.385 --> 24:31.960
(Jiangnan Municipal People's Hospital)

24:41.749 --> 24:42.549
Grandma.

24:44.150 --> 24:44.870
You're awake.

24:49.989 --> 24:51.350
Hua.

24:57.830 --> 24:58.989
You performed the surgery

25:00.229 --> 25:01.630
on me?

25:06.309 --> 25:06.989
Yes.

25:08.989 --> 25:09.635
Good.

25:11.590 --> 25:12.235
Good.

25:19.910 --> 25:21.150
Who's she?

25:24.229 --> 25:25.110
Grandma.

25:26.110 --> 25:26.670
Grandma,

25:28.150 --> 25:29.269
she's my wife,

25:29.789 --> 25:30.590
Fang Mujing.

25:32.150 --> 25:32.950
Grandma.

25:34.350 --> 25:35.549
Fang Mujing.

25:37.190 --> 25:38.229
Beautiful.

25:39.590 --> 25:40.590
Beautiful.

25:42.630 --> 25:43.630
This name

25:44.910 --> 25:45.910
is beautiful.

26:00.910 --> 26:01.549
Mujing,

26:02.910 --> 26:04.910
would you like to hear the story of Yan?

26:09.150 --> 26:09.789
Yes.

26:14.830 --> 26:17.185
This is where we first met.

26:18.269 --> 26:19.272
I was standing

26:20.430 --> 26:21.229
right here.

26:25.150 --> 26:27.235
The scenery then was just like now.

26:28.309 --> 26:29.430
The flowers were blooming.

26:33.390 --> 26:34.590
She walked toward me

26:36.029 --> 26:37.110
like a flower herself.

26:43.430 --> 26:44.197
And...

26:44.989 --> 26:46.309
she became my first love.

26:47.789 --> 26:48.630
Later,

26:49.390 --> 26:50.350
she had a brain tumor.

26:51.630 --> 26:52.870
It was critical.

26:53.549 --> 26:54.910
I performed the surgery.

26:57.590 --> 26:59.110
Because of that surgery,

26:59.989 --> 27:01.509
both my love and my career

27:02.509 --> 27:03.509
failed at the same time.

27:06.350 --> 27:08.150
I admit when I first met you,

27:08.509 --> 27:09.789
I was dazed.

27:09.989 --> 27:11.150
I thought she had come back.

27:11.749 --> 27:13.585
When I started getting close to you,

27:14.029 --> 27:16.110
I did treat you as her substitute.

27:17.110 --> 27:18.870
I couldn't save her,

27:21.590 --> 27:23.950
but at least, I could be good to you.

27:26.150 --> 27:27.229
Have I done my job well

27:27.789 --> 27:28.709
as a substitute?

27:36.830 --> 27:37.469
No.

27:38.749 --> 27:39.910
Not at all.

27:42.830 --> 27:43.789
You shine too brightly.

27:44.989 --> 27:46.630
You could never be anyone's substitute.

27:47.590 --> 27:48.390
You are you.

27:48.789 --> 27:49.630
You are Fang Mujing

27:51.430 --> 27:52.590
and my wife.

27:56.190 --> 27:56.989
I know

27:58.350 --> 27:59.590
when you first married me,

28:00.029 --> 28:01.709
it was because of my family background.

28:02.590 --> 28:04.910
I thought you wouldn't
fall in love with me,

28:05.648 --> 28:07.182
and I wouldn't fall in love with you.

28:09.830 --> 28:10.789
But I was wrong.

28:14.190 --> 28:14.989
Fang Mujing,

28:16.930 --> 28:18.337
I've fallen in love with you.

28:22.549 --> 28:23.590
This is where

28:23.590 --> 28:24.910
Yan and I first met.

28:26.549 --> 28:27.350
Now,

28:28.670 --> 28:29.709
I want to formally

28:30.870 --> 28:31.789
say goodbye to her.

28:35.430 --> 28:36.749
After we return to Jiangcheng,

28:37.293 --> 28:39.390
there are some books
I'd like to move into your dorm.

28:40.590 --> 28:42.029
Will you give me a hand?

28:45.630 --> 28:46.309
Of course.

29:06.272 --> 29:09.097
(No. 44, Kangnan Road)

29:32.989 --> 29:33.989
You're still drawing?

29:33.989 --> 29:35.509
How many have you drawn?

29:35.830 --> 29:36.910
I won't change.

29:36.910 --> 29:38.029
I look the same.

29:38.830 --> 29:39.989
You look the same.

29:40.426 --> 29:41.670
But the setting is different.

29:42.110 --> 29:43.910
I've never drawn you
in this home before.

29:51.671 --> 29:53.110
After you go to university,

29:54.229 --> 29:55.350
I can take them out and look

29:55.709 --> 29:56.870
when I miss you.

29:58.430 --> 30:00.150
I'm just going to university.

30:00.430 --> 30:01.830
It's not like I won't come back.

30:01.989 --> 30:03.709
One semester is four months.

30:04.789 --> 30:05.630
That's too long.

30:15.709 --> 30:16.590
Stop studying for now.

30:16.830 --> 30:18.110
You can study after you enroll.

30:19.630 --> 30:20.537
What are you doing?

30:20.630 --> 30:21.430
What?

30:23.029 --> 30:24.590
It's past 11 PM.

30:24.910 --> 30:26.309
What if you wake your parents?

30:26.426 --> 30:27.500
It's fine. I'll be gentle.

30:28.350 --> 30:28.870
Let go.

30:31.309 --> 30:32.830
Close the curtains.

30:32.950 --> 30:33.549
Okay.

30:37.950 --> 30:38.670
If we reverse

30:38.670 --> 30:39.870
this formula...

30:39.870 --> 30:41.069
Professor Wu, I'm back.

30:42.110 --> 30:43.269
Mujing, you're back.

30:44.670 --> 30:46.190
We've all been waiting for you.

30:47.004 --> 30:49.020
Was Qu Hua's grandmother's surgery
successful?

30:49.029 --> 30:49.870
Very successful.

30:49.870 --> 30:50.749
That's good.

30:50.893 --> 30:51.870
I'll get back to work.

30:51.870 --> 30:52.309
Alright.

30:54.630 --> 30:56.430
Ms. Mu,

30:56.709 --> 30:58.910
there are a few papers here
you might want to look at.

30:59.269 --> 31:01.749
They're not exactly in your field,

31:01.789 --> 31:02.989
but you can read them.

31:08.630 --> 31:09.269
Mujing,

31:09.269 --> 31:10.469
let me introduce you.

31:10.789 --> 31:12.269
This is Ms. Mu Shanhe.

31:12.469 --> 31:15.190
A senior in the Mathematics Department
at Jiangcheng University.

31:15.469 --> 31:17.989
If you have any questions,
you can ask her.

31:28.269 --> 31:29.069
Nice to meet you,

31:30.390 --> 31:31.190
Ms. Fang.

31:34.150 --> 31:34.870
Ms. Mu,

31:35.471 --> 31:36.980
I'll be counting on your guidance.

31:41.029 --> 31:42.269
Arriving soon.

31:42.390 --> 31:42.910
Alright.

31:47.672 --> 31:49.710
(Humility Leads to Progress,
Pride Leads to Downfall)

31:49.749 --> 31:50.549
Hello.

31:50.630 --> 31:51.350
Heading out?

31:53.630 --> 31:54.469
Check.

32:05.430 --> 32:07.269
What's this?

32:08.789 --> 32:09.469
Check.

32:13.785 --> 32:14.410
(Pawn)

32:14.460 --> 32:15.248
(Soldier)
Take it.

32:17.597 --> 32:18.860
(Cannon)

32:21.789 --> 32:23.029
Move the horse to block.

32:29.972 --> 32:32.422
(Cannon, Chariot, Minister)

32:38.469 --> 32:39.509
Slide the cannon across.

32:40.937 --> 32:41.800
(Cannon)
That one.

32:43.347 --> 32:43.847
(Cannon)

32:44.460 --> 32:45.410
(Cannon)

32:48.190 --> 32:49.989
A true gentleman watches the game
in silence.

32:50.469 --> 32:51.709
Liu, you're right.

32:51.989 --> 32:53.630
He's a true gentleman. He's my in-law.

32:55.285 --> 32:55.960
(Cannon)

32:58.471 --> 32:58.890
(Chariot)

33:13.972 --> 33:15.547
(Cannon)

33:16.540 --> 33:17.426
(Cannon)
Check!

33:21.737 --> 33:22.937
- Continue.
- I'm done.

33:25.069 --> 33:26.269
Don't go.

33:26.670 --> 33:28.110
It's your turn.

33:30.110 --> 33:30.870
Fang,

33:30.989 --> 33:31.749
sit.

33:32.069 --> 33:34.190
You're really good at Chinese chess.

33:34.430 --> 33:35.630
Your son's impressive.

33:35.670 --> 33:36.989
You're even better than him.

33:37.069 --> 33:38.269
I taught him.

33:38.269 --> 33:39.029
Really?

33:39.469 --> 33:39.910
If so,

33:40.150 --> 33:41.549
could you teach me?

33:42.950 --> 33:43.749
Sure.

33:44.582 --> 33:45.350
Here's the thing.

33:45.590 --> 33:47.190
I don't take advantage of people.

33:47.830 --> 33:48.390
You

33:48.709 --> 33:49.910
teach me chess,

33:50.190 --> 33:52.190
I'll teach you Tai Chi.

33:54.469 --> 33:55.630
Tai Chi?

34:02.590 --> 34:03.390
Ms. Mu.

34:06.989 --> 34:08.589
I have a question.

34:08.870 --> 34:10.669
It's about twin primes.

34:10.669 --> 34:11.310
Leave it there.

34:11.790 --> 34:13.509
I'll come find you
after I finish reading.

34:37.960 --> 34:39.329
I went to your dorm earlier,

34:39.330 --> 34:40.471
but you weren't there.

34:41.693 --> 34:43.110
(Educators must first be educated.)

34:43.149 --> 34:43.950
Still busy?

34:44.790 --> 34:46.390
Almost done. Wait for me.

34:47.830 --> 34:49.069
We can head home together.

35:03.069 --> 35:03.870
Ms. Fang,

35:04.230 --> 35:06.109
I've marked my notes

35:06.669 --> 35:08.509
on the twin primes issue.

35:08.509 --> 35:09.149
Alright.

35:20.870 --> 35:22.430
Is that your new colleague?

35:22.669 --> 35:23.750
I haven't seen her before.

35:28.790 --> 35:29.710
That's my mother.

35:33.029 --> 35:33.950
Mu Shanhe.

35:49.669 --> 35:50.430
Mujing,

35:51.589 --> 35:54.029
since you're in the same office
with her,

35:55.069 --> 35:57.189
apologize to her.

35:57.870 --> 35:58.989
You're family after all.

35:59.629 --> 36:00.750
You don't know her.

36:01.204 --> 36:02.782
The one thing she can't tolerate

36:02.989 --> 36:05.149
is betrayal.

36:06.029 --> 36:07.830
You had your reasons.

36:07.830 --> 36:09.270
Who hasn't had their own reasons?

36:12.549 --> 36:13.989
When my dad was sent to Yunnan,

36:15.029 --> 36:17.469
she could've cut ties with him

36:17.950 --> 36:19.390
and stayed at the university.

36:20.750 --> 36:21.750
But she didn't hesitate

36:21.950 --> 36:23.509
and packed up and went with him.

36:25.629 --> 36:27.669
When Fang Muyang had just finished
middle school,

36:28.310 --> 36:29.750
he could've written a statement

36:29.750 --> 36:31.350
and stayed two more years in school.

36:32.737 --> 36:35.230
But he said nothing
and went to Great Northern Wilderness.

36:37.910 --> 36:38.750
Only me.

36:55.547 --> 36:58.122
(Thesis Topic and Background)

37:11.430 --> 37:11.989
Dad,

37:12.830 --> 37:15.310
your Tai Chi is getting better.

37:15.750 --> 37:19.109
I'm now the inheritor
of Fei-style Tai Chi.

37:21.830 --> 37:22.669
Do you know?

37:23.310 --> 37:25.870
This is your family's ancestral manual.

37:25.870 --> 37:27.830
Your dad passed it to me.

37:29.029 --> 37:30.149
It was his treasure.

37:30.149 --> 37:31.509
You must learn it well.

37:31.870 --> 37:32.669
Don't worry.

37:32.669 --> 37:33.950
I'll cherish it.

37:43.029 --> 37:43.589
Dad,

37:44.629 --> 37:46.950
do you want to have your own manual?

37:48.350 --> 37:50.310
I've barely learned to walk,

37:50.310 --> 37:51.989
and you want me to run?

37:52.109 --> 37:53.549
I'm not talking about Tai Chi.

37:53.710 --> 37:54.710
I mean painting.

37:55.910 --> 37:56.549
You see,

37:56.750 --> 37:57.950
you taught my dad

37:57.950 --> 38:00.060
and Mr. Liu
with just a little instruction,

38:00.069 --> 38:02.230
and they're already painting
quite decently.

38:02.230 --> 38:04.069
It feels like such a waste

38:04.310 --> 38:05.710
if you only teach them.

38:06.560 --> 38:07.535
I think

38:07.535 --> 38:10.935
you could sort out your insights
and publish them.

38:10.989 --> 38:12.589
Let young people who love painting

38:12.589 --> 38:13.870
see your guidance

38:13.870 --> 38:14.669
and advice.

38:14.870 --> 38:16.509
Wouldn't that be meaningful?

38:19.453 --> 38:21.110
(Song Dynasty Poet Huang Tingjian
once wrote)

38:21.149 --> 38:21.870
Fei Ni,

38:22.549 --> 38:23.750
I'm not sure

38:23.750 --> 38:25.149
how much of my words

38:25.149 --> 38:26.830
you really understand.

38:26.950 --> 38:27.790
These are things

38:27.790 --> 38:30.950
I've written over the years.

38:30.950 --> 38:32.509
You can take a look.

38:33.069 --> 38:33.790
Also,

38:33.910 --> 38:36.270
you need to study these paintings.

38:36.629 --> 38:38.310
If you're going to organize my writings,

38:38.340 --> 38:39.870
you must have some basic understanding

38:39.870 --> 38:42.469
of Chinese painting.

38:42.469 --> 38:44.069
Otherwise, it won't work.

38:44.669 --> 38:45.109
Alright.

38:45.110 --> 38:46.671
(Painter Qi Baishi)
I'll read carefully.

38:46.693 --> 38:49.120
If there's anything I don't understand,
I'll ask Fang Muyang.

38:49.189 --> 38:50.710
Don't ask him.

38:51.197 --> 38:52.790
He always slacked off

38:52.790 --> 38:55.310
when he learned to paint as a kid.

38:55.310 --> 38:56.669
His skills aren't great.

38:56.989 --> 38:58.310
If you have questions, ask me.

38:59.715 --> 39:01.350
She doesn't need to ask anything.

39:02.350 --> 39:02.790
Dad,

39:03.430 --> 39:04.950
the person sitting in front of you

39:04.950 --> 39:05.950
is about to enroll

39:06.189 --> 39:08.270
in the Chinese Department.

39:09.149 --> 39:10.589
Having her be your writer

39:10.950 --> 39:12.230
is a bit of a waste.

39:12.750 --> 39:14.350
I wasn't talking about Fei Ni.

39:14.350 --> 39:17.069
I meant you.
Your skills aren't good enough.

39:17.069 --> 39:18.310
If my skills aren't good,

39:18.310 --> 39:19.710
it's because you taught me.

39:19.710 --> 39:21.671
What I taught you
was traditional ink painting.

39:21.680 --> 39:22.620
The bold freehand style.

39:22.629 --> 39:25.589
What you draw is a comic.

39:26.469 --> 39:27.350
Not good.

39:27.350 --> 39:29.750
I'm making my living drawing that.

39:29.750 --> 39:31.293
If you mastered ink painting,

39:31.310 --> 39:33.499
one painting could earn you
the same as ten comics.

39:33.500 --> 39:35.493
Back in the day, someone offered
to trade me a car

39:35.537 --> 39:36.980
for my painting...

39:37.335 --> 39:41.022
(The Great Socialist
Motherland Is Thriving)

39:41.710 --> 39:43.629
For one, raise one bead.

39:44.509 --> 39:48.810
For two, raise two beads.

39:50.029 --> 39:54.950
For three, raise five and drop

39:56.870 --> 39:57.509
two beads.

40:00.230 --> 40:01.469
For four...

40:04.722 --> 40:05.642
Four...

40:06.430 --> 40:07.270
Four...

40:09.350 --> 40:10.870
Keep going.

40:10.870 --> 40:11.950
Add four.

40:13.629 --> 40:14.509
Four...

40:14.509 --> 40:16.069
I don't remember that.

40:16.937 --> 40:19.060
You've only learned up to three
after all this time?

40:21.149 --> 40:22.149
I told you

40:22.149 --> 40:23.390
I'm not cut out for this.

40:24.270 --> 40:25.782
(Abacus Manual)
The books you gave me,

40:25.910 --> 40:27.989
(Abacus)
I can't get through a single word.

40:28.149 --> 40:30.509
Is it that you can't understand,
or you just don't want to?

40:30.626 --> 40:33.310
If you used the time
you spend playing basketball to read,

40:33.310 --> 40:33.669
you...

40:33.669 --> 40:34.750
That's impossible.

40:37.549 --> 40:39.149
Although our team has disbanded,

40:39.230 --> 40:40.669
I'm still going to play.

40:41.390 --> 40:43.230
Can't you show a little ambition?

40:43.350 --> 40:45.471
What are you planning to do
for the rest of your life?

40:46.109 --> 40:47.059
I'm working as a worker.

40:47.060 --> 40:48.582
What's so unambitious about that?

40:48.610 --> 40:50.182
If you like calculating, then you do it.

40:50.293 --> 40:50.871
Ye Feng!

40:51.382 --> 40:52.582
What's wrong with you?

40:52.590 --> 40:54.500
Are you planning to
spend your whole life cooking?

40:54.509 --> 40:56.589
I'd rather cook
than fiddle with the abacus.

40:57.080 --> 40:58.582
Whoever wants to calculate can do it!

41:06.549 --> 41:07.189
Ling Yi,

41:07.509 --> 41:08.870
don't be mad at him.

41:09.149 --> 41:10.710
I'll talk to him later.

41:39.935 --> 41:43.422
(Based on Zhang Hua's text, Gu Kaizhi
adopted a horizontal scroll format)

41:47.270 --> 41:48.350
Not bad.

41:49.310 --> 41:51.910
When I first wrote it,
there were a few parts

41:52.582 --> 41:55.549
I wasn't satisfied with,
so I took the liberty of revising them.

41:55.549 --> 41:56.830
You think it works?

41:56.980 --> 41:58.093
The revisions are good.

41:59.069 --> 42:01.149
Very specific and accurate.

42:02.109 --> 42:05.509
Then from now on, every Monday,
Wednesday, and Friday after work

42:05.509 --> 42:06.989
will be our working time.

42:07.390 --> 42:07.830
Alright.

42:08.029 --> 42:08.830
It's settled.

42:09.109 --> 42:09.469
Good.

42:10.109 --> 42:10.509
Dad.

42:12.149 --> 42:13.950
You told Fang Muyang

42:14.549 --> 42:17.989
that the comic isn't as good
as ink painting.

42:18.589 --> 42:19.790
I think

42:20.270 --> 42:24.469
comics can be meaningful, too.

42:24.469 --> 42:27.069
Fang Muyang puts a lot of heart into it.

42:27.671 --> 42:29.230
There should be draft sketches at home.

42:29.230 --> 42:30.430
I'll find them for you.

42:30.589 --> 42:31.430
Show me.

42:44.950 --> 42:45.469
Here.

42:53.710 --> 42:55.189
Are these his drawings?

42:56.989 --> 42:57.669
Yes.

42:59.629 --> 43:00.710
Not bad.

43:00.935 --> 43:02.019
(Revision Suggestions)

43:02.020 --> 43:03.271
(1. Replace the female textile worker.)
These drawings feel grounded

43:03.271 --> 43:04.239
in real life.

43:04.240 --> 43:06.715
(Remove the surgeon. Guoqiang's image
lacks strength and may be unnecessary.)

43:06.790 --> 43:07.390
Very good.

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
